1
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,800
(Airport announcements in Malayalam & English)
Dublin flight EK-531 now boarding at gate 4.

2
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,100
Ashley... ninte bag okke check-in cheytho?
(Ashley, did you check in all your bags?)

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,400
Cheythu, Justin chetta... Ellaam cheythu.
(Yes Justin, everything is done.)

4
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:35,500
Ini oru varsham kazhinje njan thirichu varu...
(I will only return after a year and a half...)

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,200
(Vishnu Vijay instrumental flute music fades in)
Angamalyile Bethlehem Kudumba Unit il vechu kandamuttumbol njan ithonnum karuthiyilla.
(When we met at the Bethlehem Kudumba Unit in Angamaly, I never imagined any of this.)

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,600
Justin chetta... ee choir song njan Dublin il poyalum paadum.
(Justin, even in Dublin I'll sing this choir song.)

7
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:21,500
Nee poyi padikku Ashley. Njan ivide thanne kaanum.
(You go and study Ashley. I will be right here waiting.)

8
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
(Two years earlier - Mundakkayam to Angamaly shift)
Appan paranju, namukku Angamalyilekku maaram ennu.

9
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:52,000
Puthiya veedu... puthiya kudumba unit... puthiya jeevitham.
(New house... new kudumba unit... a new life.)
